description: Immersive reader UX constraints
globs: "**/reader/**/*.{kt,kts}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Immersive reader

- Default view = text only (no persistent toolbar, FAB, badges, promo chips)
- Reveal essential chrome on tap: progress, chapter prev/next, font/theme
- Persist and restore reading progress per work
- If `textRu` exists for chapter, show it by default; else original
- Support EPUB and FB2 offline from local storage
- Prefer calm typography; avoid decorative clutter in the reading surface
